From: VNDegen <vndegen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:42:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] web: List a movie's own context menu items for the host page

A host that turns Ruffle's context menu off, because a right click belongs
to the game, can still list the items the movie added and choose one.
---
 .../core/src/internal/player/inner.tsx        | 33 +++++++++++++++
 .../internal/player/ruffle-player-element.tsx | 20 ++++++++-
 web/src/lib.rs                                | 42 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/web/packages/core/src/internal/player/inner.tsx b/web/packages/core/src/internal/player/inner.tsx
